## TL;DR FOR VIRELAIS

You may **look at VirelaiOS**.

You may **talk about VirelaiOS**.

You may **link to VirelaiOS**.

GitHub may let you **fork VirelaiOS on GitHub** because that is part of using GitHub.

You may **not take VirelaiOS code and use it for your own shit** unless you get written permission.

The source is public.

The rights are not.
